Cumulative Output of &quot;The ICT-58 indicator is defined as &quot;&quot;Total number of women participating in the distribution of futurephones and who have been trained in the use of ICT through these futurephones.&quot;&quot; and should follow the outcome �Phones distributed to women and training in their use� of activity AT4. This activity has been canceled. This indicator is used to monitor Nanatech activity and measures the �number of women participating in the different training components and who were equipped with smartphones during the duration of the program�. The target of 5000 used here is not in line with Nanatech's target (Entrepreneur=45, Immersion=135) 
For Q17 we have : Entrepreneur=45, Immersion=130

The interpretation of this indicator must be done taking into account this comment&quot;
